OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'severe' deterrents
OL,4,Aafter airport drone disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have called for deterrents to be
OL,7,F"severe" to prevent drones being flown
OL,8,Fillegally near Jersey Airport, which
OL,9,Fhas led to disrupted and diverted
OL,10,Fflights.
OL,12,FFlights were affected on Friday and
OL,13,FSaturday evenings after unauthorised
OL,14,Fdrone activity was reported, leading to
OL,15,Fservices being cancelled or diverted to
OL,16,Fother airports, including Paris.
OL,18,FIslanders said the disruption caused
OL,19,Fhad been ridiculous and were worried it
OL,20,Fcould happen again unless the
OL,21,Fperpetrators were "frightened" from
OL,22,Fdoing so.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
